WEBVTT

00:38.628 --> 00:46.592
You wanted power You wanted clean A hollow sound

00:46.672 --> 00:53.876
from a thin machine You tried to tune me out You

00:53.896 --> 00:59.193
tried to change the dial But I've been waiting

00:59.574 --> 01:03.887
all this while

01:06.090 --> 01:11.715
I am the static. I am the noise. The signal

01:11.855 --> 01:20.022
breaking. The hidden voice. I am the static. The

01:20.182 --> 01:26.568
feedback whale. The story that you try to

01:26.628 --> 01:27.408
derail.

01:39.449 --> 01:46.451
This isn't temper, this isn't grace. This is the

01:46.571 --> 01:53.834
sound of a different place. This is the heart you

01:53.854 --> 01:56.695
try to hide.

01:58.475 --> 02:09.082
The part of us that never dies. I am the static, I

02:09.102 --> 02:15.604
am the noise The signal breaking, the hidden

02:15.664 --> 02:23.087
voice I am the static, the feedback whale The

02:23.107 --> 02:28.069
story that you try to derail

02:35.645 --> 02:35.905
Oh.

03:06.328 --> 03:13.115
I am the static, I am the noise, the signal

03:13.195 --> 03:21.463
breaking, the hidden voice. I am the static, the

03:21.523 --> 03:27.949
feedback whale, the story that you try to

03:27.989 --> 03:38.153
derail. I am the static, I am the static Can you

03:38.213 --> 03:39.173
hear me now?

